  "description": "From the first 8bar KRZBERG back in 2011 to now — this is our 8th evolution. Each version had its own kind of perfection, but we believe there’s always room to push further.\n\nThe 8bar KRZBERG v8 stands for speed and exceptional design. Developed with German engineering, its aggressive and unique geometry is built for fast and agile riding.\n\nDepending on what you want, this frame can be perfect for city riding, crit racing, and velodrome use.\n\nAll KRZBERG bikes are pure fixed-gear or singlespeed machines — a declaration of love to the original roots of 8bar.\n\nSLOPING GEOMETRY\n\nNow lighter and more comfortable for high-speed fixed gear racing, crits, and velodrome sessions. The frame is made exclusively of high-quality materials: it is crafted from triple-butted 6061 lightweight aluminium, which makes it stiff, light and durable at the same time.\n\nBOOSTED STIFFNESS\n\nRedesigned tubing profile ensures direct power transfer and high-speed control.\n\nREFINED TUBING\n\nOval top tube for improved aerodynamics and a clean look.\n\nCUSTOM DROPOUTS\n\nCustom dropouts with 8bar logo and double-sided stainless steel plates.\n\nWIDER TIRES WELCOME\n\nWide tire clearance up to 32mm for frame and fork for better comfort.\n\nBOTTLE CAGE MOUNT\n\nStay hydrated, ride longer!\n\nPOLISHED LOGO\n\nPolished 8bar logos on top and head tube: subtle shine, bold character.",
